10	 * atomaton-runner.wac.ts) so the decision is computed even when the agent run
11	 * itself failed or was skipped entirely -- shouldReleaseGuard()'s own rule
12	 * 1 handles that case (any non-'success' outcome releases the guard).
13	 * `--outcome` is expected to carry GitHub Actions' own `steps.atoma.outcome`
14	 * value directly ("success" | "failure" | "cancelled" | "skipped").
15	 *
