17	 * NOT hard-fail (process.exit) on a missing/empty `--outcome`. This script
18	 * always runs under `always()`, and its entire purpose is to decide whether
19	 * a lock (the in-progress label) gets released -- exiting before writing
20	 * `should_release` to $GITHUB_OUTPUT would leave the downstream "Remove
